        "## 4. Stratified 80/10/10 Split\n",
        "Collects every image path and its class label into flat arrays, then performs a stratified 80/10/10 split into train/validation/test sets so each class is proportionally represented in all three. Also checks that every class has at least one image in every split and prints a summary table of counts per class."
